    "label": "8",
    "prompt": "Sartoro invested $\\$80\\,000$ in a building society that pays $6.5\\%$ p.a. simple interest. Over the years, the investment has paid him $\\$57\\,200$ in interest. How many years has he had the investment?",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "11 years",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{aligned}I&=PRT\\\\57\\,200&=80\\,000\\times0.065\\times T\\\\57\\,200&=5200T\\\\T&=\\frac{57\\,200}{5200}\\\\T&=11\\end{aligned}$$\nHe has had the investment for 11 years.",
